    "description": "Analyze, design, code, and test real-time embedded software.\n\nOrion Multi-Purpose Crew Vehicle\n• Developed the Software Requirement Specifications for the Orion Vehicle flight software.\n• Converted, modified, coded, and tested 25,000 lines of code for the Orion Smart Mass Memory Card flight software.\n• Optimized hardware/software architecture to support high rate video recording to the Smart Mass Memory Card with minimal software interaction.\n• Architected, designed, implemented, and tested software for the NASA Orion NAND-Flash management system\n• Designed, implemented, and integrated hardware device drivers for PCI, ASIC (application-specific integrated circuit) clock, custom NAND Flash Controller, and custom NIC adapter.\n• Optimized overall system performance to meet demanding 40Hz processing constraints.\n• Performed build and integration manager role in delivering product to the customer.\n• Successfully demonstrated early file system prototype to NASA and other stakeholders for proof of concept.",
